# Layer 1 — raw, immutable sources

This directory holds raw captures exactly as they came in. The AI reads these
but NEVER edits them. One file per capture, named `YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`, with
provenance frontmatter (see CLAUDE.md). Redact secrets/credentials before saving.

This .keep file keeps the directory in version control. See the fictional
example alongside it for the expected format.
